  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.1-preview - Performance & Compatibility Update\n🆕 .NET 10 Support Added! Future-proof your applications\n📈 Improved test coverage to 95% (228/240 tests passing)\n📚 Comprehensive DocFX documentation with GitHub Pages\n🔧 Enhanced command parser for combined options (-sS, -sSL)\n🌐 Better header handling with -i flag\n✅ All 300+ curl options supported\n💎 Sponsored by IronSoftware\n\nDocumentation: https://jacob-mellor.github.io/curl-dot-net/\nRepository: https://github.com/jacob-mellor/curl-dot-net",
